  "question": {
    "text": "If two tangents drawn from the point <math><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></math> to the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;are such that the slope of one of the tangent is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> times the slope of the other, then the locus of point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is"
  },
